flowchart TD
  A[Landing page] --> B{Have an account?}
  B -->|No| C[Sign up]
  B -->|Yes| D[Sign in]
  C --> E{18+ and consents?}
  E -->|Under 18| F[Bounced at the door]
  E -->|Missing consents| G[Error: accept terms + privacy]
  E -->|OK| H[Account created]
  D --> H
  H --> I[Account: card status, tokens, profile]
  I --> J[Get your card, verify]
  J --> K{Brutus consent?}
  K -->|No| L[Verify page: consent required]
  K -->|Yes| M[Stripe Identity hosted check]
  M --> N{Verified?}
  N -->|Failed, retryable| N2{Less than 3 retries?}
  N2 -->|Yes| J
  N2 -->|No| N3[Escalate to Support]
  N -->|Yes| O[VIP badge + 20 tokens]
  O --> P[Profile setup: draftable \\(3 photos, name, bio\\)]
  P --> P1[🎉 Congratulations! You're inside the club]
  P1 --> Q[Browse the floor]

  Q --> R{Browse card actions}
  R -->|Message cold| S{User Tier?}
  S -->|Free| S1[Thread: 30 msgs/day cap]
  S -->|Gold| S2[Thread: 75 msgs/day cap]
  S -->|Premium| S3[Thread: Unlimited]
  S1 --> Q
  S2 --> Q
  S3 --> Q
  R -->|Pass| Q
  R -->|Like| T{Mutual pick?}
  T -->|No| Q
  T -->|Yes| U[It's a match]
  U --> V[Chat thread: tier limits apply]
  V --> Q
  V --> W[Report or Block]
  S1 --> W
  S2 --> W
  S3 --> W
  W --> X[Moderation review]
  X --> X1{Outcome}
  X1 -->|Content removed / Warning| X2[Action taken]
  X1 -->|Account suspended| X3[Account suspended]
  X1 -->|No action| X4[No action]
  X2 --> Q
  X3 --> Q
  X4 --> Q

  Q --> Y[Dance Floor - Phase 2]
  Y --> Y1{Sufficient tokens?}
  Y1 -->|No| Y2[Purchase / Top-up tokens] --> Y1
  Y1 -->|Yes| Z[Reserve 3 tokens entry]
  Z --> AA[Grid: 2-min selection, 10 picks]
  AA --> AA1{Timeout?}
  AA1 -->|Yes| AC[Release token hold] --> Q
  AA1 -->|No| AB{First mutual click?}
  AB -->|No match| AC
  AB -->|Match| AD[One-song chat: 3 min]
  AD --> AE{Continue?}
  AE -->|Yes| AF[Match + badge \\(Tokens spent\\)] --> Q
  AE -->|Decline| AG[Chat closes, hold released] --> Q
